A long time ago, before planets were a commercial business, this planet
was claimed by the federation and colonized as a mining station.
This was fine for a few years, but when the Feds bent under the pressure
to allow common folk into space, things began to fall apart.

The common man was thrilled to be able to go from one planet to another,
as easily as a city to city transport, but it was only a matter of time
untill the Cybergangs hijacked a Dexxon Interliner and began plundering
worlds for their own profit.  This world is infested with pirates!

The pirates have a city, moveable, able to burrow into the ground to avoid
detection, as well as many mechs scouring the planet for ore.

At first a great battle ensued, the Feds provided a new weapon, called a
Cryonizer.  This great gun was used to destroy the pirates, but alas!
A second wave moved in one night and sabotaged the 4 key parts of
the Cryonizer.  If you could find the 4 parts, and bring them to me, i might
be able to repair the gun, I of course would pay VERY well for this...

